   "game_time": [
    "Dark Angels Infantry, Vehicles & Walker units always count as controlling an Objective regardless of how many enemy models are contesting it.",
    "In addition, during deployment randomly select 1 enemy unit in your opponent's army with the Character special rule. If that model is slain in the Combat Phase by wound inflicted by a Dark Angels unit, the Dark Angels player gains D3 Victory points. If the chosen unit is slain by any other means or is not slain during the battle, the Dark Angels player loses D3 Victory Points."
   ],
